WEBVTT - Class 1 English Mridang Chapter 4: The Cap Seller and the Monkeys

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
<v Teacher Tara>Under the warm afternoon sun, a cap seller carries a basket full of bright red, blue, and green caps. He rests under a huge shady banyan tree.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:30.000
<v Teacher Tara>Look up in the leafy branches! Playful monkeys swing down quietly. Each monkey grabs a cap and puts it right on its head!

00:01:30.000 --> 00:02:15.000
<v Teacher Tara>The seller wakes up: "Oh no, my caps!" He scratches his head—the monkeys scratch their heads. He claps his hands—the monkeys clap their hands!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:03:00.000
<v Teacher Tara>The seller smiles: "I know what to do!" He flings his own cap onto the green grass. Whoosh! All the monkeys throw their caps down too! Problem solved with a calm smile!

